# Static scene of box, sphere, capsule and hull shapes, probed by ray, overlap
# and shape-cast queries. No simulation: a single step establishes the broadphase.
expect pos 0.0002 rot 0.001 vel 0.01 horizon 1 counts exact
world gravity 0 0 0 dt 1 60 substeps 1 steps 1
body static position -3 1 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
body static position -1 1 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
body static position 1 1 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
body static position 3 1 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 0 box 0.5 0.5 0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
shape 1 sphere 0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
shape 2 capsule 0.25 0.5 axis 0 1 0 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
shape 3 hull points 4 0.5 0 0.5 -0.5 0 0.5 -0.5 0 -0.5 0.5 0 -0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
query raycast origin -3 1 5 translation 0 0 -10
query raycast origin -1 1 5 translation 0 0 -10
query raycast origin 1 1 5 translation 0 0 -10
query raycast origin 3 1 5 translation 0 0 -10
query overlap_aabb lower -3.5 0.5 -0.5 upper -2.5 1.5 0.5
query overlap_aabb lower -1.5 0.5 -0.5 upper -0.5 1.5 0.5
query overlap_shape origin -3 1 5 box 0.2 0.2 0.2
query overlap_shape origin -1 1 5 sphere 0.3
query shape_cast origin 1 1 5 translation 0 0 -10 sphere 0.25
query shape_cast origin 3 1 5 translation 0 0 -10 box 0.2 0.2 0.2
query closest_points 0 1
query mover origin 0 3 5 0.25 0.25 translation 0 0 -10
